@using NexusFlow.AppCore.Constants
@inject NexusFlow.AppCore.Interfaces.ICurrentUserService CurrentUser
@{ ViewData["Title"] = "Migration Centre"; }
<div id="migrationCentre" class="container-fluid pb-5"
     data-prepare="@CurrentUser.HasPermission(Permissions.Migration.Prepare).ToString().ToLowerInvariant()"
     data-approve="@CurrentUser.HasPermission(Permissions.Migration.Approve).ToString().ToLowerInvariant()"
     data-execute="@CurrentUser.HasPermission(Permissions.Migration.Execute).ToString().ToLowerInvariant()"
     data-finalize="@CurrentUser.HasPermission(Permissions.Migration.Finalize).ToString().ToLowerInvariant()">
    @Html.AntiForgeryToken()
    <div class="d-flex justify-content-between flex-wrap gap-3 mb-3"><div><h3 class="mb-1">Migration Centre</h3><p class="text-muted mb-0">One opening position. Upload everything together or complete selected scopes as data arrives.</p></div><a class="btn btn-outline-primary align-self-start" href="/api/migration/projects/templates">Download Template Pack</a></div>
    <div id="mcMessage" class="alert d-none" role="status" aria-live="polite"></div>
    <div class="card card-body mb-3"><div class="row g-3"><div class="col-md-8"><label class="form-label" for="mcProject">Saved migration project</label><select id="mcProject" class="form-select"><option value="">Choose a project</option></select></div><div class="col-md-4 d-flex align-items-end gap-2"><button id="mcNew" class="btn btn-primary" type="button">New Project</button><button id="mcRefresh" class="btn btn-outline-secondary" type="button">Refresh Progress</button></div></div><p id="mcProjectSummary" class="small mt-3 mb-0"></p></div>
    <form id="mcCreate" class="card card-body mb-3 d-none"><h5>Create migration project</h5><p>Enter the actual go-live date. The old system closing snapshot must be the previous evening, in Asia/Colombo. October activity stays in the old system until this switch; earlier history stays in the read-only archive.</p><div class="row g-3"><div class="col-md-4"><label for="mcName" class="form-label">Project name</label><input id="mcName" class="form-control" maxlength="120" required></div><div class="col-md-4"><label for="mcSource" class="form-label">Stable source system identifier</label><input id="mcSource" class="form-control" maxlength="80" required placeholder="LEGACY-ERP"></div><div class="col-md-4"><label for="mcOpening" class="form-label">Actual go-live opening date</label><input id="mcOpening" class="form-control" type="date" required></div></div><button class="btn btn-primary align-self-start mt-3" type="submit">Create Project</button></form>
    <div class="small mb-3"><label for="mcAdoption" class="form-label">Existing customer batch adoption evidence (only when creating a project at the same original opening date)</label><input id="mcAdoption" class="form-control" placeholder="Leave blank for a fresh migration; existing batches and journals will be retained"></div>
    <div id="mcWorkspace" class="d-none">
        <nav class="d-flex gap-2 flex-wrap mb-3" aria-label="Migration steps">
            <a class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-secondary" href="#mcUploads">1 Upload</a><a class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-secondary" href="#mcMappings">2 Map</a><a class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-secondary" href="#mcSelection">3 Select</a><a class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-secondary" href="#mcReview">4 Validate &amp; approve</a><a class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-secondary" href="#mcProgress">5 Execute</a><a class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-secondary" href="#mcScopes">6 Reconcile &amp; release</a><a class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-secondary" href="#mcFinal">7 Final sign-off</a>
        </nav>
        <section id="mcUploads" class="card card-body mb-3"><h5>1. Upload closing data</h5><p>CSV, values-only XLSX, or the supplied legacy XLS formats. Files are retained as evidence. Uploading creates staging rows; balances change only after approval and execution. Missing data stays <strong>Awaiting data</strong>.</p><form id="mcUpload"><div class="row g-3"><div class="col-md-4"><label for="mcModule" class="form-label">Dataset</label><select id="mcModule" class="form-select"></select></div><div class="col-md-5"><label for="mcFile" class="form-label">File, up to 20 MB</label><input id="mcFile" class="form-control" type="file" accept=".csv,.xls,.xlsx" required></div><div class="col-md-3 d-flex align-items-end"><button class="btn btn-primary" type="submit">Upload Dataset</button></div></div></form><form id="mcPackage" class="d-flex flex-wrap gap-2 mt-3"><label for="mcZip" class="align-self-center">Or upload a ZIP package with manifest.json</label><input id="mcZip" class="form-control w-auto" type="file" accept=".zip" required><button class="btn btn-outline-primary" type="submit">Upload Package</button></form><div class="table-responsive mt-3"><table class="table table-sm"><thead><tr><th>Dataset</th><th>Revision</th><th>Closing date</th><th>Original file</th><th>Status</th></tr></thead><tbody id="mcFiles"></tbody></table></div></section>
        <section id="mcMappings" class="card card-body mb-3"><h5>2. Map and confirm source treatment</h5><p>Choose exact existing masters and posting accounts. Create any missing lookup, account, warehouse or bank branch in its master page first. Genuine blank contact details are allowed and flagged for completion.</p><div class="row g-3" id="mcDefaults"></div><hr><div class="row g-2"><div class="col-md-3"><label for="mcMapType" class="form-label">Mapping type</label><select id="mcMapType" class="form-select"></select></div><div class="col-md-3"><label for="mcLegacy" class="form-label">Exact legacy code</label><input id="mcLegacy" class="form-control" maxlength="100"></div><div class="col-md-4"><label for="mcTarget" class="form-label">NexusFlow master</label><select id="mcTarget" class="form-select"></select></div><div class="col-md-2 d-flex align-items-end"><button id="mcAddMap" class="btn btn-outline-primary" type="button">Add Mapping</button></div></div><div id="mcMapList" class="small mt-3"></div><details class="mt-3"><summary>Change source column mapping</summary><div class="row g-2 mt-1"><div class="col-md-3"><label for="mcColumnModule" class="form-label">Dataset</label><select id="mcColumnModule" class="form-select"></select></div><div class="col-md-3"><label for="mcCanonical" class="form-label">Required field</label><select id="mcCanonical" class="form-select"></select></div><div class="col-md-4"><label for="mcSourceColumn" class="form-label">Source column</label><select id="mcSourceColumn" class="form-select"></select></div><div class="col-md-2 d-flex align-items-end"><button id="mcAddColumn" class="btn btn-outline-primary" type="button">Map Column</button></div></div><div id="mcColumnList" class="small mt-2"></div></details><hr><h6>Required data and zero declarations</h6><div id="mcDataStates" class="row g-3"></div><hr><div class="row g-3"><div class="col-md-6"><label for="mcSummaryStock" class="form-label">Summarized stock layer approval, if original FIFO layers are unavailable</label><textarea id="mcSummaryStock" class="form-control" rows="2" placeholder="Approval reference and explanation"></textarea></div><div class="col-md-6"><label for="mcFgValuation" class="form-label">Legacy finished goods valuation</label><select id="mcFgValuation" class="form-select"><option value="">Awaiting approved valuation / use corrected canonical stock file</option><option value="AverageCost">Average cost (avar × warehouse quantity)</option></select><label for="mcFgEvidence" class="form-label mt-2">Valuation discrepancy resolution evidence</label><textarea id="mcFgEvidence" class="form-control" rows="2"></textarea></div><div class="col-md-4"><label for="mcSupplierDays" class="form-label">Approved supplier terms in days (optional)</label><input id="mcSupplierDays" class="form-control" type="number" min="0" max="3650" placeholder="Use document due date"></div></div><button id="mcSaveMaps" class="btn btn-primary align-self-start mt-3" type="button">Save Mappings and Evidence</button></section>
        <section id="mcSelection" class="card card-body mb-3"><h5>3. Select this import</h5><p>Select modules. Leave code filters blank to include every code in those modules. A code selection always includes every opening row for that code; invoices are not cherry-picked. Other missing scopes can be completed later at the same closing date.</p><div id="mcModules" class="d-flex flex-wrap gap-3 mb-3"></div><div class="row g-3"><div class="col-md-3"><label for="mcCustomers" class="form-label">Customer codes</label><textarea id="mcCustomers" class="form-control" rows="2" placeholder="Comma or newline separated"></textarea></div><div class="col-md-3"><label for="mcSuppliers" class="form-label">Supplier codes</label><textarea id="mcSuppliers" class="form-control" rows="2"></textarea></div><div class="col-md-3"><label for="mcSkus" class="form-label">SKU codes</label><textarea id="mcSkus" class="form-control" rows="2"></textarea></div><div class="col-md-3"><label for="mcBanks" class="form-label">Bank account codes</label><textarea id="mcBanks" class="form-control" rows="2"></textarea></div></div><button id="mcValidate" class="btn btn-primary align-self-start mt-3" type="button">Validate Selected Import</button></section>
        <section id="mcReview" class="card card-body mb-3"><h5>4. Review and approve</h5><div id="mcPreview"><p class="text-muted">Validate a selection to review normalized rows, errors and proposed journals.</p></div><label for="mcApprovalEvidence" class="form-label">Approval evidence</label><textarea id="mcApprovalEvidence" class="form-control" rows="2" placeholder="Closing reports, complete party positions, stock valuation and physical cheque verification reference"></textarea><button id="mcApprove" class="btn btn-primary align-self-start mt-3" type="button" disabled>Approve Selected Import</button></section>
        <section id="mcProgress" class="card card-body mb-3"><h5>5. Execute and monitor</h5><p>Posting runs in the background. Each party or SKU commits atomically; a failed run retains completed work and resumes only unfinished work.</p><button id="mcExecute" class="btn btn-success align-self-start" type="button" disabled>Execute Approved Import</button><div id="mcRuns" class="mt-3"></div><details class="mt-3"><summary>Posted units and unused-unit reversal</summary><div id="mcUnits"></div></details></section>
        <section id="mcScopes" class="card card-body mb-3"><h5>6. Reconcile and release scopes</h5><p>Pending scopes remain locked. Enter independently checked legacy totals and row counts before release. A full stock scope covers every warehouse. New-system entities need an evidenced <strong>No legacy opening</strong> classification.</p><div class="table-responsive"><table class="table table-sm"><thead><tr><th>Kind</th><th>Legacy code</th><th>State</th><th>Required components</th><th>Action</th></tr></thead><tbody id="mcScopeRows"></tbody></table></div><details><summary>Add a new-system scope</summary><form id="mcNewScope" class="row g-2 mt-1"><div class="col-md-2"><label for="mcScopeKind" class="form-label">Kind</label><select id="mcScopeKind" class="form-select"><option>Customer</option><option>Supplier</option><option>Stock</option><option>Bank</option></select></div><div class="col-md-3"><label for="mcScopeCode" class="form-label">Exact mapped code</label><input id="mcScopeCode" class="form-control" required></div><div class="col-md-5"><label for="mcScopeEvidence" class="form-label">Evidence: no legacy opening</label><input id="mcScopeEvidence" class="form-control" required></div><div class="col-md-2 d-flex align-items-end"><button class="btn btn-outline-primary" type="submit">Classify New Entity</button></div></form></details><div id="mcReconcile" class="mt-3"></div></section>
        <section id="mcFinal" class="card card-body mb-3"><h5>7. Full ledger reconciliation and final sign-off</h5><p>After releasing every opening scope, import the complete closing trial balance. Its residual journal excludes post-go-live trading and cannot plug managed control differences. Finalization requires all financial data, every source row and a zero difference for each account; the project then becomes read-only.</p><button id="mcLedger" class="btn btn-outline-primary align-self-start" type="button">Check Full Ledger</button><div id="mcLedgerResults" class="mt-3"></div><label for="mcFinalEvidence" class="form-label">Final financial sign-off evidence</label><textarea id="mcFinalEvidence" class="form-control" rows="2"></textarea><button id="mcFinalize" class="btn btn-success align-self-start mt-3" type="button">Finalize Migration</button></section>
        <section class="card card-body mb-3"><h5>Release multiple reconciled scopes</h5><p>For a complete package or many selected parties, import a separate <strong>Control Totals</strong> schedule from the legacy closing reports. It must include every component's amount and row count, including zero components. The selected modules and code filters above determine the scopes to release. A failed control leaves that scope pending.</p><label for="mcBulkEvidence" class="form-label">Signed independent schedule evidence</label><textarea id="mcBulkEvidence" class="form-control" rows="2"></textarea><button id="mcBulkRelease" class="btn btn-outline-success align-self-start mt-2" type="button">Release Selected Reconciled Scopes</button><div id="mcBulkResults" class="small mt-2"></div></section>
        <details class="card card-body"><summary>Migration audit</summary><div id="mcAudit" class="small mt-3"></div></details>
    </div>
</div>
@section Scripts { <script src="~/js/migration/centre.js" asp-append-version="true"></script> }
